moebiusV              maintainer; C reimplementation (2026-)

The original JavaScript implementation, kept under Attic/, was written by
GitYVR and contributors, notably Eric Chennells, Owen (omurovec), Leonhard
Weese, Hui Zheng and Steven Luscher.  See the git history for details.

compat/imsg.c, imsg-buffer.c, imsg.h and imsg_init.3 are from OpenBSD's
libutil (ISC license); see the notices in those files.
